31
00:05:30.747 --> 00:05:35.417
When you were with
the girls. L thought
you'd like it.

32
00:05:54.645 --> 00:05:57.272
You can have
this room. L'm gonna
get set up out there.

33
00:06:02.653 --> 00:06:04.237
