139
00:20:33.774 --> 00:20:35.149
Hello?

140
00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.949
WOMAN: Ls
Tamara home?

141
00:20:47.371 --> 00:20:49.789
You already
came by here.

142
00:20:50.832 --> 00:20:52.250
Are you sure?

143
00:20:58.674 --> 00:20:59.966
(FOOTSTEPS FADING)

144
00:21:26.201 --> 00:21:27.827
