148
00:22:38.774 --> 00:22:40.274
(BANG ON DOOR)

149
00:22:42.944 --> 00:22:44.653
(KNOCKING ON DOOR)

150
00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:53.579
(BANG ON DOOR)

151
00:23:08.345 --> 00:23:09.595
