190
00:30:36.960 --> 00:30:38.585
Jamie.
Kristen.

191
00:30:39.754 --> 00:30:41.463
There is
someone
out there.

192
00:30:41.548 --> 00:30:43.257
What are you doing? What?
There's something...

193
00:30:43.341 --> 00:30:45.008
They'll hearyou.
Stop, stop, stop.

194
00:30:45.093 --> 00:30:46.093
Shh!

195
00:30:46.177 --> 00:30:48.387
What happened
to your hand?

196
00:30:48.471 --> 00:30:50.097
